                    {
                        "description": "tab switching in terminals: left cmd + m and left cmd + , become left option + m and , which ghostty binds to previous_tab and next_tab. Left cmd only, so right cmd keeps cmd+m minimise and cmd+, open_config. m and comma are bound in neither .inputrc nor .zshrc, so nothing in the shell loses out. The left option + m this emits is also the app-switch rule's trigger and does not set it off; that rule says why.",
