                    {
                        "description": "tab switching in firefox: left cmd + m and left cmd + , become cmd+option+left and cmd+option+right, which are firefox's own previous and next tab on mac. Not ctrl+tab, which can be set to recently-used order rather than positional. Same deal as the terminal rule: left cmd only, so right cmd keeps cmd+m minimise and cmd+, settings. Another browser is another bundle id here.",
